    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 7.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif frigman freolsdæge wyrce, þolie his freotes oððe gylde wíte, lahslite. Ðeowman þolie his hyde oððe hydgyldes.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a freeman works during a church festival, he shall be reduced to slavery, or pay a fine or lahslit. A slave shall undergo the lash or pay the fine in lieu thereof.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf friman freolsdæge wyrce, ðolie his freotes oððe gylde wíte, lahslite. Ðeowman ðolie his hyde oþþe hydgyldes.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
